  "structure": {
    "block_count": 42,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Miscarriage Quotes to Help Bring You Comfort",
        "text_sha256": "ca8e54bc3848b367dbd8e7cca465bf122e3ffa3e29de55685b3956bf1bc1dc6c",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "flowers coming out of an envelope",
        "text_sha256": "247d6330e295dcbd66100107fac476029bab7dc0c981ba21fb4273afede1c9d9",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“A life need not be long-lived for it to be meaningful.” Plus more words of wisdom and support for those going through a pregnancy loss.",
        "text_sha256": "930372ed86595210fba7db6206d2bc6312a0bbc35602cd7def6cbcaf94a86412",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Experiencing a pregnancy loss is devastating. If you're coping with a miscarriage , stillbirth, medical loss or losing a child after birth, you are probably in need of comfort and reassurance that you're not alone.",
        "text_sha256": "33828414f8ec8782f95af9e0bae6f983bbee037041edc1dbb90243815a8b8747",
        "word_count": 35
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "While no healing journey is the same, it may help to hear phrases of wisdom, guidance and support from others who know what you’re going through, and who have experienced the same type of grief themselves.",
        "text_sha256": "9fa461b1cae2b2ee38d104185caa393b8ca87c996e97542d3d20dded3aee0594",
        "word_count": 36
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Here are some quotes about grief and loss that may help bring you some comfort.",
        "text_sha256": "c019ee25640af32e580dc205096280c119154432f4f8550e75744b7adcbc692a",
        "word_count": 15
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"If there ever comes a day when we can't be together, keep me in your heart; I'll stay there forever.\" — Winnie the Pooh",
        "text_sha256": "3d0bd882a36d3e4db22eca9621b434b999e940554a7f918f2e2cb2789d835708",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“I held you every second of your life.” — Stephanie Paige Cole",
        "text_sha256": "c0f4ce374d1cee18769db84590870aba3dc434c47c2cfbf4621927e4294340ba",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“A life need not be long-lived for it to be meaningful.” — Unknown",
        "text_sha256": "d65dc63c0b0fdf3e93e410ba8200a9fee1bda38a1e832665d2989473af34e41f",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“I don’t think of all the misery, but of all the beauty that remains.” — Anne Frank",
        "text_sha256": "6d943727731f9a7426723c5ee15b810be40d2bd0a844adc74870db61240a1190",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“How very softly you tiptoed into our world, almost silently, only a moment you stayed. But what an imprint your footsteps have left upon our hearts.” — Dorothy Ferguson",
        "text_sha256": "471c8c252ba906c1edfbe32466d0064b9355aa90fc0480655eb505ebdeb8963a",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“There is no greater agony than bearing an untold story inside you.” — Maya Angelou",
        "text_sha256": "0c01abca4e3d59b25300d2cce5791246c3dffbf475a230f4b1e6c1e21d8468d5",
        "word_count": 15
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“You never arrived in my arms, but you will never leave my heart.” — Zoe Clark-Coates",
        "text_sha256": "9e6693141b498f35c9740efefb4877d2c187be1fad34b43fca428f9701abce78",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“You are near, even if I don’t see you. You are with me, even if you are far away. You are in my heart, in my thoughts, in my life, always.” — Unknown",
        "text_sha256": "68784567acb64ec685d275d781a89ad8b25d84d4b984c6426b904879edbc28fb",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“What we have once enjoyed deeply we can never lose. All that we love deeply becomes a part of us.” — Helen Keller",
        "text_sha256": "d53af1a70107ecb9631c59039d70baf704d8090ad6e1c7390e1dd79c892d73aa",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“There is no right way to grieve; there is only your way to grieve, and that is different for everyone.” — Nathalie Himmelrich",
        "text_sha256": "a819045a25e94a2cc723547bff6f81e823272f435f546b42ba57ba440faa6bb6",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“Grief is the last act of love we can give to those we loved. Where there is deep grief, there was great love.” — Unknown",
        "text_sha256": "4d2071fac2cf9557f36523c459e59b22c3d673f1166ca50f8a4edadbadc5e2a4",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“There is a unique pain that comes from preparing a place in your heart for a child who never comes.” – David Platt",
        "text_sha256": "8447009749ddd22ea3d2c2879ae0ef953798415d48c6b2af70368380b98f67ac",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“Even those who never fully blossom bring beauty into the world.” — Unknown",
        "text_sha256": "75444cb911c16a5cf888006089adc0fe0889edbc4f193d35f86474153f9782ef",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“It hurts because it matters.” — John Green",
        "text_sha256": "a4401e63532a2bde85afcdf0e4a3dc5c56b9a882132e45fbf02af85d15a3ba39",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“Grief is like the ocean; it comes in waves ebbing and flowing. Sometimes the water is calm, and sometimes it is overwhelming. All we can do is learn to swim.” — Vicki Harrison",
        "text_sha256": "38f79bf74a97b1ad0095c8e14f0c9af19cec1611b6eac5a9aff849635d170017",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"Babies lost in the womb were never touched by fear. They were never cold, never hungry, never alone and importantly always knew love.\" — Zoe Clark-Coates",
        "text_sha256": "52c61612ff5f371200d92164badfa0a73a40e00668508c1886e509beb9ac30e0",
        "word_count": 26
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“A life may last just for a moment, but memory can make that moment last forever.” — Unknown",
        "text_sha256": "3d1dda88e57d997da3cc13b0757c2adbcbb908473f9aca62694fc7043fc05aef",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"You will survive and you will find purpose in the chaos. Moving on doesn't mean letting go.\" — Mary VanHaute",
        "text_sha256": "9cc09f085a921a140edf3d382c4e2d519a712b3b8c30f136fa3ea3900f326c18",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
